{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26115","headline":"送薛补阙入朝 · 鲍溶","name":"送薛补阙入朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平原门下十余人，独受恩多未杀身。\n每叹陆家兄弟少，更怜杨氏子孙贫。\n柴门已断施行马，鲁酒那能醉近臣。\n赖有军中遗令在，犹将谈笑对风尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}